' 图4-8 核心逻辑实体关系图
' 只标逻辑基数，不写未经核对的字段名和物理外键。
@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 140
skinparam defaultFontName "WenQuanYi Micro Hei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam nodesep 50
skinparam ranksep 42
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam ArrowFontSize 13
skinparam ClassBorderColor #4B4F51
skinparam ClassFontColor #222222
skinparam LegendBorderColor #4B4F51
skinparam LegendBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam LegendFontColor #222222

hide circle
hide members
hide methods

together {
  class "商品关联" as Goods #E8F5E9
  class "本地价格日历" as Calendar #E8F5E9
}

together {
  class "插件记录" as Plugin #FFF3E0
  class "本地执行单" as Exec #E8F5E9
  class "供应商订单关联" as ExtOrder #E3F2FD
}

together {
  class "业务身份与\n供应商配置" as Id #FFF3E0
  class "调用记录" as Call #FFF3E0
  class "电子凭证" as Voucher #E3F2FD
  class "退款执行记录" as Refund #FFF3E0
}

Goods -down-> Exec : 1:N
Goods -down-> Calendar : 1:N
Exec -right-> ExtOrder : 1:0..1
Exec -down-> Voucher : 1:N
Exec -down-> Refund : 1:N
Exec -left-> Call : 1:N
Plugin -down-> Id : 1:N 绑定
Plugin -down-> Call : 1:N
Refund -left-> Voucher : 多对多\n按退款范围

legend bottom
  1:N 表示零个或多个。1:0..1 表示没有或只有一个。
  图中不预设物理外键和字段名。
endlegend

@enduml
